cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Abandoned Graffiti Mill (Früen Mill, Minneapolis): drone photogrammetry"
abstract: >-
  A complete drone photogrammetry image set of the abandoned Früen Mill in the Bassett Creek
  valley, Minneapolis, and its graffiti, captured October 11, 2026 with a DJI FC9313 at native
  4096x3072 resolution. 1,896 images, 233 of them taken inside the building at three spots
  reached through open window bays, 230 of them solved together with the exterior. GPS intact on every
  frame, original aircraft filenames preserved; faces are blurred in 30 images and license plates
  in 3, the other 1,863 are camera originals. Solved camera poses in COLMAP format and a
  sparse tie point cloud are included, and the solve is metrically scaled from a 1.996 m
  AprilTag calibration bar used as control points. The license covers the photographs and
  data, not the graffiti artworks in them.
authors:
